                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really glad I rediscovered this old gem. I used to play it a lot when it first came out. The game loop is pretty fun, and you can replay it a lot, although I'd advise taking pauses of at least a few weeks after a few games since it's a game from an era where memory over a few GB was a privilege, so the content is somewhat limited. I would really love if the game got a sequel or was opened again to development",
